{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04073","headline":"奉和圣制途经华岳应制 · 苏頲","name":"奉和圣制途经华岳应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝望莲华岳，神心就日来。\n晴观五千仞，仙掌拓山开。\n受命金符叶，过祥玉瑞陪。\n雾披乘鹿见，云起驭龙廻。\n偃树枝封雪，残碑石冐苔。\n圣皇惟道契，文字勒岩隈。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏頲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04073.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04073","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}